WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.631
Welcome to Module 4 of the
Data Platform and SQL Server

2
00:00:03.631 --> 00:00:07.162
Identity learning path: Entra
logins and the parallel run.

3
00:00:07.162 --> 00:00:09.025
This is the migration itself.

4
00:00:09.025 --> 00:00:11.758
You add the Entra login
beside the Windows one,

5
00:00:11.758 --> 00:00:14.562
prove it works, and only
then turn the old one off.

6
00:00:14.562 --> 00:00:16.650
The module follows runbook R five,

7
00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:21.200
and Chapter 4 of the developer
workbook, Building SQL Server Identity.

8
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.940
Take it after Module 3.
